    "W8-recreated-generation-starts-its-own-counter"
   ],
   "holds": true,
   "statement": "A governed-deleted id reports 0 to any writer: a re-created generation starts its own counter (snapshot v0, before v0, after v1, history 1), a refused or policy-parked proposal on the tombstoned id reports v0/v0, and the former owner's view keeps the version its deletion recorded and cannot write, dispute or re-delete the id while the new generation is live."
  }
